      "priority": 1,
      "action": "Recover the original phase before/after stage and SQL snapshots and preserve missing/unknown/failure/in-flight counters before differencing; use existing observation first.",
      "limit": "Whole-phase deltas include failed later rounds and cannot be assigned to the confirmed seven-packet prefix. SQL API wall is not isolated physical fsync."
    },
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "action": "If a future normal baseline is instrumented, add bounded per-original-operation counts and measured sleep intervals only at the actual observe_with_control wait branch, tied to existing semantic phase; preserve original callbacks, deadlines, errors, charging and refill constants.",
      "limit": "Do not infer sleep by subtracting CPU from wall; retain incomplete/unknown values and observer overhead."
    },
    {
      "priority": 3,
